# Not found

`/steve.png` does not exist on MCRender.

## Where to go next

- [Sitemap](https://www.mcrender.net/sitemap.xml) — every public HTML page
- [llms.txt](https://www.mcrender.net/llms.txt) — short index for language models
- [Document catalog](https://www.mcrender.net/api/md/_catalog) — markdown twins of product pages
- [OpenAPI](https://www.mcrender.net/openapi.json) — public API description
- [Auth](https://www.mcrender.net/auth.md) — there is no API key; every surface below is public
- [MCP](https://www.mcrender.net/mcp) — search poses, read docs, get pricing

There is no render API. Rendering runs in the browser. Hand the user a pose URL
from the sitemap or the MCP `search_poses` tool instead of trying to export
an image on their behalf.